      "produces": null,
      "image": "https://cos.onmicrosoft.cn/cook/steps/other_nai-lao-pei-gen-tong-xin-fen/step_4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "title": "炒香洋葱大蒜",
      "instruction": "加入洋葱炒至软化，随后加入蒜末炒出香味。",
